# DESK01b -- Options -> Set preferences..., then Cancel, on the base image.
#   Options title 160..232; drop-down entry 6 ("Set preferences...")
#   at y = 19 + 6*16 = 115..131.
# The dialog is now 390x244 (ADSETPRE's 32 px row pitch + 8 px gaps);
# form_center -> x = (640-390)/2 = 125, y = 19 + (480-19-244)/2 = 127.
#   Cancel = 125 + 390/2 + 10 = 330 .. +90, 127 + 192 .. +28 -> centre (375, 333)
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 196 8
1800 mark B_OPTIONS_OPEN
2100 move 200 123
2300 down
2303 up
2600 parkbr
3000 mark C_PREFS
3300 move 375 333
3500 down
3503 up
3800 parkbr
4200 mark D_CLOSED
